# Go Slice Operations Project Rules

This project provides comprehensive documentation and examples for Go slice operations.

## Project Structure

- `README.md` - Main documentation with detailed explanations
- `QUICKSTART.md` - Quick start guide for beginners
- `CHEATSHEET.md` - Quick reference for common operations
- `sliceops.go` - Reusable slice operation functions library
- `sliceops_test.go` - Unit tests and benchmarks
- `examples/` - 8 comprehensive example programs demonstrating different aspects

## Code Style

- Follow standard Go conventions
- Use descriptive variable names in examples
- Include comments explaining concepts
- Provide both English and Chinese documentation where applicable

## Running Examples

All examples can be run individually or through the interactive menu:

```bash
cd examples
go run main.go
```

## Testing

Run all tests:
```bash
go test -v
```

Run benchmarks:
```bash
go test -bench=. -benchmem
```
